<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 8	 Nov 7	 DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  237.770     238.510     237.040    0.31 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  302.510     302.460     303.640   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.065     158.000     165.490   -4.49 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.732	46.742	48.410   -3.47 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  391.780     393.140     366.280    6.96 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.935     140.860     147.886   -4.70 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.674	15.688	14.975    4.67 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  213.670     213.000     230.135   -7.15 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.877	 1.876	 1.939   -3.20 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.561	 1.562	 1.575   -0.89 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  187.870     183.375     206.030   -8.81 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
